\cb3 We don't know what version we're working with. We don't know who owns the data. We don't know who has access to data. It's all very complex. And that's something that Databricks aims to solve. And yeah, and doing it in the compliant way, so all your data is sitting within the region, making sure we have the strong controls on it.\cb1 \
